.TH SCANERO 1 "19 Nov 2026" "Scanero IP scanner 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
scanero \- modern local network scanner for Ubuntu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scanero
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Scanero IP scanner
discovers devices in local IPv4 networks, resolves names, identifies vendors
and open services, and can open SMB/FTP/HTTP/RDP resources. It also supports
Wake-on-LAN, remote shutdown of Windows hosts, favorites, history and reports.
.PP
Run without arguments to start the graphical interface.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-cli
Run the command-line scanner instead of the GUI.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help.
.PP
Use
.B scanero \-\-cli \-\-help
for command-line scanning options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/scanero/settings.json
Application settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/scanero/favorites.json
Saved favorites.
.TP
.I ~/.config/scanero/history.json
Scan history.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/kostya4000/Scanero-IP-scanner
.SH AUTHOR
kostya4000
